─────────────────────────────────────────────  
Step 3. Decompose Dish Retrieval

Under G2, we further split the dish retrieval into two parts:

1. G2.1: Identify and Pick Up Dirty Dishes  
   • Type: Perform  
   • This goal involves locating and physically retrieving dirty dishes.

2. G2.2: Door Opening  
   • Type: Perform  
   • This goal is necessary if the door is closed and may require cooperation with another robot or a human.

